Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":50,"y":3731,"w":126,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/st-fiber-patch-cord","text":"ST Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":200,"y":3721,"w":154,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"ST Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":214,"y":3731,"w":126,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtrj-fiber-patch-cord","text":"MTRJ Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":108,"y":3766,"w":174,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTRJ Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":122,"y":3776,"w":146,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/lc-uniboot-and-lc-extractor-micro-cable","text":"LC Uniboot and LC Extractor Micro Cable","box":{"x":53,"y":3812,"w":285,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"LC Uniboot and LC Extractor Micro Cable","box":{"x":67,"y":3822,"w":257,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/armored-fiber-patch-cord","text":"Armored Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":99,"y":3857,"w":192,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"Armored Fiber Patch Cord","box":{"x":113,"y":3867,"w":164,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtp-mpo-array-cable","text":"MTP/MPO Array Cable","box":{"x":18,"y":3903,"w":171,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTP/MPO Array Cable","box":{"x":32,"y":3913,"w":143,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/mtp-mpo-trunk-cable","text":"MTP/MPO Trunk Cable","box":{"x":199,"y":3903,"w":173,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"MTP/MPO Trunk Cable","box":{"x":213,"y":3913,"w":145,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./products/fiber-adapters","text":"Fiber Adapters","box":{"x":134,"y":3949,"w":122,"h":36}},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber Adapters","box":{"x":148,"y":3959,"w":94,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Why source it through Vocom","box":{"x":16,"y":4149,"w":358,"h":69},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Build-to-order: specified to your route, count and jacket, not off a fixed shelf.","box":{"x":36,"y":4306,"w":318,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Fujikura preform glass: tier 1 manufacturing, consistent quality.","box":{"x":36,"y":4442,"w":318,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Lead times that move: supply when domestic loose-tube is quoted months out.","box":{"x":36,"y":4577,"w":318,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Import/export handled: documentation, customs and delivery coordinated.","box":{"x":36,"y":4713,"w":318,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Founded in 1998: a supplier that also runs networks.","box":{"x":36,"y":4848,"w":318,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"FTTH drop cable FAQ","box":{"x":16,"y":5020,"w":358,"h":35},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"G.657.A1 or A2, which do we need?","box":{"x":38,"y":5104,"w":314,"h":48},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"A2 holds the tighter bend spec and is what most indoor and in-home work actually needs. A1 has fewer requirements and is fine on a straighter run. If the cable is going round door frames and into a room, specify A2.","box":{"x":38,"y":5162,"w":314,"h":149},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Do you supply pre-connectorized drops?","box":{"x":38,"y":5367,"w":314,"h":48},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes, with OptiTap compatible connectors to IP68 and GR-3120. Whether that beats field termination depends on your crew rate and your volume, and we are happy to work the numbers with you rather than push one.","box":{"x":38,"y":5425,"w":314,"h":149},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"What protects against rodent damage?","box":{"x":38,"y":5630,"w":314,"h":48},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"The armored drop series, NSS and SS, uses spiral armor for mechanical and rodent protection. It costs more per foot and saves more per callout.","box":{"x":38,"y":5688,"w":314,"h":99},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Can we reorder the same spec?","box":{"x":38,"y":5843,"w":314,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes. Specs are held against your account, so a repeat order is a quantity and a date rather than a fresh conversation.","box":{"x":38,"y":5877,"w":314,"h":99},"links":[]},{"t":"h3","text":"What is an OptiTap compatible connector?","box":{"x":38,"y":6032,"w":314,"h":48},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"OptiTap is the common name for a hardened, sealed fiber drop connector format, first designed by one manufacturer and now available as compatible connectors from several sources. It lets a pre-connectorized drop be plugged into a terminal outdoors, in minutes and without splicing. Vocom supplies OptiTap compatible connectors rated IP68 and built to GR-326 and GR-3120, alongside flat drop cable.","box":{"x":38,"y":6090,"w":314,"h":273},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Need a Fiber Built to Your Exact Specification?","box":{"x":50,"y":6116,"w":290,"h":97},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber count, jacket, rating and connector, we can source and build any fiber optic cable to match your spec.","box":{"x":50,"y":6225,"w":290,"h":96},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"./contact-vocomai","text":"Talk to a Specifier","box":{"x":94,"y":6333,"w":202,"h":45}},{"t":"p","text":"Talk to a Specifier","box":{"x":116,"y":6348,"w":132,"h":15},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":17},{"t":"a","href":"./","text":"","box":{"x":60,"y":6552,"w":33,"h":35}},{"t":"img","src":"https://framerusercontent.com/images/TTIbUaJpCfUwzR62SUUmiGgRfM.png?width=226&height=243","alt":"Vocom logo","box":{"x":60,"y":6552,"w":33,"h":35},"nat":[226,243]},{"t":"p","text":"Your partner for telecommunications and fiber optic supply.","box":{"x":60,"y":6614,"w":270,"h":82},"links":[]},{"t":"a","href":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/vocomai","text":"","box":{"x":60,"y":6712,"w":35,"h":35}},{"t":"svg","w":35},{"t":"p","text":"Quick Links","box":{"x":60,"y":6795,"w":89,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"VOCOM AI","box":{"x":60,"y":6838,"w":81,"h":27},"links":["./"]},{"t":"p","text":"Services","box":{"x":60,"y":6877,"w":66,"h":27},"links":["./vocom-services"]},{"t":"p","text":"RenOS AI Agents","box":{"x":60,"y":6916,"w":129,"h":27},"links":["./vocom-ai-agents"]},{"t":"p","text":"Resources","box":{"x":60,"y":7003,"w":81,"h":27},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"